<title>USA: LESLIE-ADM CORN PRODUCTION SURVEY BY STATES.</title>
<headline>LESLIE-ADM CORN PRODUCTION SURVEY BY STATES.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-08-08</dateline>
